@* Child that reports a click with a plain Action delegate instead of an EventCallback.
   The parent's method RUNS, but Blazor doesn't know the PARENT changed, so the parent is NOT re-rendered:
   its screen shows an old number until something else makes it redraw. EventCallback re-renders it automatically. *@
<button class="child" @onclick="() => OnClicked?.Invoke()">Add one</button>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public Action? OnClicked { get; set; }
}
